Cascades/Bridge/
# C846 · THE PRIVACY PARTITION — born private: the personal substrate can never enter git
# history, so the commit-locked share can never carry it (the clone travels tracked content
# only). The shareable Suite 8 face lives in Cascades/8_SUITES/<name>/ (tracked). Runtime
# self-heals absence: CWSD scaffolds Cascade.json at watcher-subscribe; Working/ and
# Extended/ materialize on first use.
#
# THE IE RETENTION (the portability difference this SCP maintains): from the ordinarily-
# private Extended substrate, the DIAMOND and ONYX documents SHIP — the working memory
# (plan + trajectory) is part of this SCP's released value. Everything else private holds
# back (frontier research, session state, Working/, Cascade.json). The `/**` file-glob form
# (not the bare dir exclude) is REQUIRED: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# DIRECTORY is excluded — the glob excludes contents while the `!*/` re-opens traversal.
Cascades/Extended/**
!Cascades/Extended/*/
!Cascades/Extended/*/DIAMOND*.md
!Cascades/Extended/*/ONYX*.md
Cascades/Working/
Cascades/Cascade.json
